  "answer_text": "You can access the login portals for PreLicenseTraining.com (PLT) using the links below:\n\n### \ud83d\udc64 Student Login\nIf you are a student taking pre-licensing or continuing education (CE) insurance courses, use the standard student login:\n* **[PreLicenseTraining Student Login](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/login)**\n* *Tip: Your login name is typically the email address you used to register unless you updated it in your account settings.*\n\n### \ud83d\udc65 Mentor / Recruiter / Company Login\nIf you manage, recruit, or track the progress of students through a company account, you can access your dashboard here:\n* **[PreLicenseTraining Mentor Portal Login](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/mentor/login)**\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd11 Troubleshooting & Recovery\nIf you are having trouble logging in to your student account, you can use these official recovery tools:\n* **[Forgot Login Name](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/forgot-login)** \u2013 Retrieve your login name by entering either your email and password, or your first/last name and password.\n* **[Forgot Password](https://www.prelicensetraining.com/forgot-password)** \u2013 Reset your password by entering your account email to receive a password reset link.\n\n*If you need direct customer support, you can call their office toll-free at **1 (800) 780-2113**.*",
